{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109006","id":2697380418,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gxsJC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109006","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109006.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109006.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109006","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109006/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109006/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109006/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3e01c8a551318c8b998156bf2fe548d6376b5bb2","number":109006,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix random pitch upward bias in `AudioStreamRandomizer`","user":{"login":"RoyBerardo","id":32561682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTYxNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32561682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyBerardo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyBerardo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103742 was requested to be split into two PRs, so here is one of them -\r\n\r\nThis fixes the random pitch upward bias as pointed out in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/10238\r\n\r\nEssentially, random_pitch is multiplicative. A pitch scale of 0.5 is down one octave, and a pitch scale of 2.0 is up one octave. 1.0 is perceptually no shift. Because 1.0 is not in the middle of 0.5 and 2.0, picking randomly between 0.5 and 2.0 will bias towards higher pitches. This PR fixes that by picking randomly between the _logs_ of the low and high values, then converting the chosen value back to a usable pitch multiplier.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"